{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"proposal.lean","explanation":"Repair only proof terms. Replace input_inhabited's invalid witness attempts and sorry with: by refine ⟨VeriSlopAST.Input.mk [] 0 0 1 \"none\", ?_⟩; cbv <;> simp_all <;> done. The current attempted witnesses have nonpositive width or an invalid fill string. Replace source_properties's proof with: by exact VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource. For complete_aggregation, prove the existing conjunction with constructor; on the value branch introduce the input and validity hypothesis, unfold solve, groups, group_rows, step, stats and bucket_count, and close with rfl; on the source branch use VeriSlop.Source.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.SolveSource. Preserve all frozen statements, definitions, imports, instances and registry entries."}]}